<title>USA: Savoy Pictures Q3 shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Savoy Pictures Q3 shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr     loss	     $0.66     loss	 $1.07</p>
<p> Net     loss	    19,461     loss	31,660</p>
<p> Revs			31,887		   22,506</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  29,680		   29,585</p>
<p>		     Nine months</p>
<p> Shr     loss	     $2.86     loss	 $1.35</p>
<p> Net     loss	    84,720     loss	39,786</p>
<p> Revs			98,848		   55,632</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  29,645		   29,548</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: The SF Broadcasting Cos acquired WVUE-TV, WALA-TV and KHON-TV on August 22, 1995 and WLUK-TV on April 28, 1995. The company said that accordingly, broadcasting results of operations for the three months and nine-months in 1996 do not have comparable results in 1995.</p>
<p>Full company name is Savoy Pictures Entertainment Inc.</p>
